  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Programme transfrontalier de promotion des solutions durables aux situations de d&#xe9;placement au Cameroun et en R&#xe9;publique Centrafricaine (RCA) - This action aims to provide durable solutions to displaced populations by providing support to and through the IGAD and CAR support platforms as well as the protection and integrated strategic frameworks for the Sahel and the Lake Chad Crisis.</narrative>
